OL,3,GNEWSAMums welcome probe into
OL,4,Alife-threatening condition
OL,5,
OL,6,FMothers who suffered from a
OL,7,Flife-threatening condition during
OL,8,Fpregnancy have welcomed a national
OL,9,Finvestigation into it.
OL,11,FErin Cooper, from Bedfordshire, is
OL,12,Famong those who developed placenta
OL,13,Faccreta spectrum (PAS), whereby the
OL,14,Fplacenta grows too deeply into the wall
OL,15,Fof the womb.
OL,17,F"It's not going to change the outcome
OL,18,Fof my or other people's stories,
OL,19,Fhowever it might prevent this happening
OL,20,Fto others," the 35-year-old said of the
OL,21,Finvestigation.
